# Environment Variables Template

Copy this to `.env.local` in your repo root and fill in values from your Supabase, Vercel, and payment provider dashboards.

## Supabase
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

## App
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

## Payment Providers - Cleva
CLEVA_API_KEY=live_xxxx or test_xxxx
CLEVA_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxx
CLEVA_MERCHANT_ID=merchant_xxxx

## Payment Providers - Moniepoint
MONIEPOINT_API_KEY=xxxx
MONIEPOINT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=xxxx
MONIEPOINT_ACCOUNT_ID=xxxx

## Payment Providers - Palmpay
PALMPAY_API_KEY=xxxx
PALMPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=xxxx
PALMPAY_MERCHANT_ID=xxxx

## Optional: Error Tracking
SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxx@sentry.io/yyyy

## Optional: Analytics
NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=G-xxxx (for Google Analytics, etc.)
